[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":98},["ShallowReactive",2],{"blog:archive:9":3},{"posts":4,"total":88,"tags":89,"tag":-1},[5,14,23,31,39,47,55,63,71,80],{"title":6,"link":7,"date":8,"dateTime":9,"description":10,"thumbnail":11,"tags":12},"【挑戰活動】網頁切版 PK 戰","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-09-13-hexschool-challenge","2018\u002F09\u002F13","2018-09-13","網頁切版，是身為網頁設計師、前端工程師第一步會學到的基本功，但學到一身切版功夫，卻苦無找不到對手，豈不就太過孤獨？這次六角學院將派出五位精銳，向各位切磋切磋！ (拱手行禮","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F09%2Fpk-character_og-image.png?alt=media&token=bf3fb8f8-f52c-4053-bfe0-39c7018dbee6",[13],"event",{"title":15,"link":16,"date":17,"dateTime":18,"description":19,"thumbnail":20,"tags":21},"【公開】如何在線上幫助學員找到前端工作","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-08-27-interview","2018\u002F08\u002F27","2018-08-27","各位好，我是六角學院的校長，洧杰，創校兩年來，我們在線上已協助超過 100 位學員錄取網頁設計師、前端工程師職缺。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F08%2Fofferget_fb.png?alt=media&token=d69db149-1486-4785-bcd4-0f4078d6a20f",[22],"interview",{"title":24,"link":25,"date":26,"dateTime":27,"description":28,"thumbnail":29,"tags":30},"如何參加線上問答會","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-08-07-how-to-join-zoom","2018\u002F08\u002F07","2018-08-07","六角學院線上問答會是額外的服務，凡購買主要課程者都可以免費參加。線上問答會期間，講師會透過直播的方式與大家介紹特定主題，除此之外，學員也可以即時的詢問老師相關問題，至今已經超過 120 場線上問答會囉。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F08%2F%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%8F%83%E5%8A%A0%E7%B7%9A%E4%B8%8A%E5%95%8F%E7%AD%94%E6%9C%83_0807.png?alt=media&token=81607ce9-1630-40af-a15b-9918b4edce23",[13],{"title":32,"link":33,"date":34,"dateTime":35,"description":36,"thumbnail":37,"tags":38},"行政轉戰前端工程師，「即戰力」是她的學習訴求 -- Clara","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-06-19-interview","2018\u002F06\u002F19","2018-06-19","Clara，雖是資管出身，面對業界要的[即戰力]，體認到學校所學的理論是不夠的！出社會幾年都是擔任行政職務，之後有了薪資方面的考量，開始立志要當「前端工程師」","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F06%2F%E7%9A%93%E7%90%B3.png?alt=media&token=b269c00b-2694-4c33-8e3e-d383b231c32e",[22],{"title":40,"link":41,"date":42,"dateTime":43,"description":44,"thumbnail":45,"tags":46},"總是從錯誤中學習，置之死地而後生 - 阿陰","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-06-18-interview","2018\u002F06\u002F18","2018-06-18","無關科系，沒有程式底子沒關係！只要有學習熱情","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F06%2Fryin.png?alt=media&token=6fb5f324-c96d-439f-968d-6c6676463152",[22],{"title":48,"link":49,"date":50,"dateTime":51,"description":52,"thumbnail":53,"tags":54},"問自己未來想要什麼？我選擇與時俱進的工作 -- Joseph","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-06-17-interview","2018\u002F06\u002F17","2018-06-17","從事過設計助理、數位廣告代理商業務、倉管，在開始思考未來方向之際看到了六角學院，開啟了 coding 人生。半年內，一家大型電商公司主動聯繫，現在擔任前端工程師一職","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F06%2F%E5%98%89%E8%B1%90.png?alt=media&token=0330137d-6221-423f-bd24-ac4116a93854",[22],{"title":56,"link":57,"date":58,"dateTime":59,"description":60,"thumbnail":61,"tags":62},"只要想著半年後的樣子，這樣的喜悅就能擊敗學習的孤獨感 - Greene","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-06-16-interview","2018\u002F06\u002F16","2018-06-16","跟朋友創業，為了自架網站，我重拾大學荒廢的學科，加入線上課程，雖然以資工背景出身，我依然從零開始","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F06%2FGreene.png?alt=media&token=9ac54c5b-9785-4568-9a16-f03bf294d5de",[22],{"title":64,"link":65,"date":66,"dateTime":67,"description":68,"thumbnail":69,"tags":70},"專精一職，涉略所有，才能有無限可能 - Simon","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-06-15-interview","2018\u002F06\u002F15","2018-06-15","Simon 非資工相關科系畢業，在畢業前因為大學教授的一句話，開始接觸前端技術，加入了六角學院學習前端技術，但因南部相關職缺少之又少且待遇並不是很友善，決定北上另尋機會，且已順利找到第二份前端工程師工作。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F06%2Fsimon.png?alt=media&token=5721dbaa-202b-45c8-acaa-c02ac9a634b7",[22],{"title":72,"link":73,"date":74,"dateTime":75,"description":76,"thumbnail":77,"tags":78},"The F2E - 前端修練精神時光屋","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-05-09-the_f2e","2018\u002F05\u002F09","2018-05-09","你想變強嗎？你想獲得力量嗎？你想透過前端改變你的生活，但找不到地方修練嗎？如果你的答案是「Yes」那麼你來對地方了！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F05%2FTheF2E_banner.png?alt=media&token=4e663e89-554e-4bed-83ac-000fddabd8ab",[79],"skilltree",{"title":81,"link":82,"date":83,"dateTime":84,"description":85,"thumbnail":86,"tags":87},"2018 前端開發者學習地圖！","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-04-16-skill_tree","2018\u002F04\u002F16","2018-04-16","很多同學會問老師前端該學到哪裡？如果我是設計師，想走前端要學哪些技能？這邊老師提供前端開發者技能樹供同學參考參考。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F04%2F%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E6%A8%B9_banner.png?alt=media&token=c6940846-4660-4223-b828-c8ca567929c4",[79],116,[90,91,92,93,94,13,22,95,96,79,97],"UI design","course","css","css3","enterprise","javascript","jobs","software engineer",1790064292951]